5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to plan this year's training camp! I want it to be a trip that everyone remembers forever. Where should we go? Let's figure out the best spot together!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a pleasure to see everyone so enthusiastic. I agree, Mio dear, let's make sure we choose a place where everyone feels welcome and can truly bond. I'm looking forward to hearing your ideas!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should start by gathering objective data. To make a sustainable decision, we need to understand the logistical and financial constraints before we let our excitement lead us toward an impractical destination.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I agree! Let's make it a giant adventure! I want to find a place that's super exciting and where we can all have the best time ever! What should we check first?,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Ryuji. We need to be careful with the planning to avoid any issues. Let's look into the available data first so we can make a realistic decision.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm curious about how we've handled the money and the people in the past! I'll check the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Attendance sheets for the away camps"" to see how things went!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I want to make sure our younger members feel included and that we can all mingle. I'll look into ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and ""Attendance sheets for the away camps.""","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will look into the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and ""Lottery and application for public group bookings."" We need to understand the actual workload involved in managing the camp's daily operations.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know if we'll be tired or super awake! I'll check the ""Vacation timetable for the club's own hall"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements"" to see how the days and nights work!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll look into the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to get a clear understanding of the actual costs before we set a budget.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a great spread of research! I can't wait to see what we find. @Ryuji, do you think the cooking duty is the hardest part of the camp? I hope it's not too stressful!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a thoughtful question, Mio. Cooking can be a lovely way to bond, but it can also be a burden if not shared. I hope we find a way to make it a joyful experience for all.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It is not just about the stress of the task, but the total time commitment. If the workload is concentrated on a few people, it compromises the purpose of the training camp. We must avoid that.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, you're always so serious! But if we have a super cool schedule, maybe the work will feel like a game! I just hope we get plenty of sleep so we can play hard the next day!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, sleep is important, but so is financial stability. If we don't account for every expense, the ""game"" becomes a problem for someone else to solve later. Let's wait for the data.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Misaki! Let's be super careful with the details so everything is fair. I'll be the cheerleader for the group while we wait! I can't wait to see what we all discover!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall be waiting patiently with a smile. I hope the information we find helps us create a warm atmosphere where every member feels they belong. I look forward to seeing you all soon!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I will focus on the operational data. Once we have the results, we can determine which destination minimizes the administrative burden and ensures that no one is unfairly overworked. I will see you in the next round.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll be the scout for the group! I'm going to find out all the secrets of the schedules so we can have the most fun and energetic camp ever! See you all soon!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on the financial data. It is better to be precise now than to deal with a deficit later. I look forward to seeing the results.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
